  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p>Putting, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>·</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>·</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>·</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>dt</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Hence optin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math> is correct</p>",
